// The object model for the C unit tests of the runtime (runtime/core/tests/*.c; ADR-0052 Addendum A, step R3d.3).
//
// The allocator, the reference-count release and the copy-on-write of the runtime core are Orin functions of `$rt` now, and the code
// a program is compiled to defines them under their C names (`orin_struct_new`, `orin_destroy`, ...) for the C shells. A test that
// links only the C files of the runtime has none of them: it also links this program compiled to C with its `main` renamed
// (tools/rt_stub.sh), which carries exactly those definitions and nothing else.
function main(): void {
}
